  "description": "Actipro Avalonia Pro is a vast set of professional UI controls and modern themes for building beautiful Avalonia applications with advanced functionality.\n\nThe optional ColorPicker themes (ActiproSoftware.Controls.Avalonia.Themes.ColorPicker package) and DataGrid themes (ActiproSoftware.Controls.Avalonia.Themes.DataGrid package) libraries are not included in this package, and must be referenced separately if needed.\n\nDocumentation is available on the Actipro web site (https://www.actiprosoftware.com/docs/controls/avalonia/index?v=26.1), and samples can be downloaded from the Actipro Avalonia Controls GitHub repository (https://github.com/Actipro/Avalonia-Controls).\n\nNOTE: This is a commercial software product and requires proper paid licensing for legal usage. See Actipro's web site (https://www.actiprosoftware.com/purchase) for links to purchase developer licenses, or view the Sales FAQ for more information about evaluations and licensing.",
